[Begin Action 7001]
; Mika's ending portrait layer, cut to the two shots the ending now uses:
; 7000,20 (Mika posing) for pages 1-2 and 7000,18 (Mika with Zangief) from
; page 3 to the end. The original ran 7000,20 / blank / 7000,19 / 7000,18 /
